{"product_id":"mastering-macromedia-dreamweaver-3","title":"Mastering Macromedia Dreamweaver 3","description":"\u003cp\u003eDreamweaver 3 is Macromedia's award-winning powerful visual tool for professional Web site design. Here is the most comprehensive book on Dreamweaver -- the only one with more than 200 bonus pages on Fireworks 3, Dreamweaver's sister software product used to create and optimize Web graphics, buttons, animated banners, and more. Written for everyone serious about top-quality Web site design, this book provides beginning to intermediate coverage and includes a companion CD with Dreamweaver 3 and Fireworks 3 trial versions, links to the most popular Dreamweaver extensions, a tutorial for building a Web site, IE 5, Acrobat Reader, Quick Time 4, and Tetran Net's LinkBot for Verifying Links. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:190 x 230  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: D. Crowder \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780782126242 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Paperback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 864\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44268626870425,"sku":"3EDU9780782126242","price":30.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/72fbb75c5e179c99f97f21ff7f42cfc8.jpg?v=1714555715","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/mastering-macromedia-dreamweaver-3","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}